  << /ActualText (Platform Ecosystem Strategy\072 Unified 15\053 trading applications under a standardized design system\054 replacing legacy fragmentation with reusable atomic components\056 Deliverd a cohesive\054 human\021centered platform experience while reducing development overhead and accelerating speed\021to\021market\056\nStrategic Leadership \046 Product Vision\072  Partnered with PM and Engineering leadership to align disparate trading squads under a unified roadmap\056 Led prioritization of high\021impact design work within technical and regulatory constraints\054 focusing on the flows that most improved client confidence and day\021to\021day usability\056\nPerformance Optimization\072 Redesigned data\021dense trading interfaces to reduce costly trade errors and service inquiries that burdened product\054 sales\054 and service teams\056 Turned legacy bottlenecks into approachable\054 clear\054 high\021velocity workflows that increased satisfaction and efficiency\056\nAI\055Driven Delivery\072 Leveraged AI\021augmented workflows to explore concepts\054 prototype\054 and test more quickly\054 enabling earlier alignment on complex\054 technical features without sacrificing craft or clarity\056)
